====Usage notes====
Depending on how one makes the divisions, one may count between 4 and 7 ''kontinenter'' on Earth, maybe most often 5 or 6 (Antarctic, Eurasia, Africa, Australia, and finally the Americas as either one or two). Only rarely would Europe and Asia be considered separate ''kontinenter''.
In contrast, the word ''[[världsdel]]'' constitutes a cultural or historical division, similar to the notion of ''kontinent''. This division  is however always done into 7 parts: [[Antarktis]], [[Sydamerika]], [[Nordamerika]], [[Europa]], [[Asien]], [[Afrika]] and [[Oceanien]].

